      "BeforeSourceContent": "# Pinned apply optimizer observations\r\n\r\nSource-only, unbuilt exporter with nine predeclared observational hypotheses. Each disposable VM stages the exact genuine260 fresh-success image, then probes callback routing without an observer. The existing native257 badmatch,false stack establishes a route signature; this tool does not claim callback lifecycle completion or monitor/DOWN parity. Raw result/complete exception stack, mailbox effects, source, BEAM, disassembly, runtime ETF, build pin, stdout/stderr/exit/stage and hashes are captured before any later comparison. Captured means observation completeness, never semantic pass.\r\n\r\nThe C# bounded capture implementation is adapted from the repository standalone loader tool into its own namespace. Original code licensing remains the owner's decision; preserved OTP attribution/notices apply to pinned reference reuse. No production/native dependency is introduced. Existing eleven loader and sixteen iodata contracts remain untouched.\r\n\r\nRequired gates: source peer/freeze before target build; actual raw nonUTF8 and inherited-pipe capture controls, CLI rejection/pin/input/source checks, pinned erlc -Werror compilation and fresh nineVM run, then independent function-specific disassembly/term analysis before compiler broadening. Unknown module/function knownarity shapes remain hypotheses. No SDK expected value is used.\r\n",
